{"id":"8dceed325a87029c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-partial-recursion-parameters.md","title":"部分索引变换的条件固定点","display":"thm-partial-recursion-parameters — 部分索引变换的条件固定点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-partial-recursion-parameters","aliases":["20-thm-partial-recursion-parameters"],"display":"thm-partial-recursion-parameters — 部分索引变换的条件固定点","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.2.7","source_printed_pages":[32],"source_pdf_pages":[68],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-partial-recursion-parameters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-partial-recursion-parameters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-partial-recursion-parameters — 部分索引变换的条件固定点"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>32</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_2\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}parameters}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall y\\ [\\psi(n(y),y)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{n(y)}=\\varphi_{\\psi(n(y),y)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}parameters}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall y\\ [\\psi(n(y),y)\\downarrow\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{n(y)}=\\varphi_{\\psi(n(y),y)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取整体单射编译器 d(x,y)，其程序先运行 φ_x^(2)(x,y)，若得索引 j 再运行 φ_j。取 v 编译二元部分函数 ψ(d(x,y),y)，定义 n(y)=d(v,y)。n 只生成代码故全定义；条件成立时自应用所得索引就是 ψ(n(y),y)。ψ 发散时不定义非法索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.2.7；印刷页 32；PDF 第 68 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":fal